.TH QUIPU-ONTOLOGY 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-ontology \- Load, list or remove OWL ontologies (owl feature)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu ontology\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Load, list or remove OWL ontologies (owl feature)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-ontology\-list(1)
List loaded OWL ontologies
.TP
quipu\-ontology\-load(1)
Load an OWL ontology and materialize its entailments
.TP
quipu\-ontology\-remove(1)
Remove a loaded OWL ontology
.TP
quipu\-ontology\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
